- Create unit tests in `test/edit_setlist_items_test.dart`:
  - Test editing song title and lyrics updates `SongSetlistItem` without mutating Isar song database.
  - Test editing single scripture reference and verse updates slides and marks `isEdited: true`.
  - Test editing dual scripture reference, primary verse, and secondary verse generates slides with overridden text.
  - Test `_buildTitleForSlide` returns custom reference when `isEdited` is true regardless of `chapterShowActual`/`chapterShowAlias`/`chapterShowNone` settings.
