  - Run `flutter test` to ensure all existing and new tests pass.

### Manual Verification
1. Launch Windows app: `flutter run -d windows`.
2. Add a Song, Scripture, Dual Scripture, Image, and Window Slide to Setlist.
3. Right-click on each item in the setlist and verify the context menu with 'Edit' appears.
4. Edit Song: change title & lyrics $\rightarrow$ verify slides and preview update immediately; verify songs database is unchanged.
5. Edit Scripture: change reference & verse $\rightarrow$ verify preview and live projection reflect the new text.
6. Edit Dual Scripture: change reference, primary verse, and secondary verse $\rightarrow$ verify preview and live projection reflect the new text.
7. Verify presentation settings changes do not overwrite manually edited scripture references.
8. Save setlist, reload, and verify all edited texts persist.
